data: {"id": "66f260a7fed042a6-thinking-parallel_evidence-484", "run_id": "66f260a7fed042a6", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "这两条 PromQL 被 `query_rejected`，因为 `execute_pod_promql` 强制要求 vector selector 中必须包含 exact `pod` matcher，而 `kube_node_status_allocatable` 和 `kube_pod_container_resource_requests` 是集群级指标，没有 `pod` label。需要换用 `execute_prometheus_instant_query` 来获取节点资源信息。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789110395257, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

